            <ArticleTitle>Effect of the beta-receptor blocking agent Visken on the action of coumarin.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>458-60</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In a double-blind study, the influence of Visken on the effect of anticoagulant therapy with Marcoumar was examined. In comparison to a placebo group, neither any influence on the Quick time, nor any increased tendency to haemorrhage bleeding could be detected.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
